# Raise Dead returns Golgari Brownscale from human's graveyard to hand. The
# moved card's own graveyard-origin ChangesZone trigger fires
# (TriggerChangesZone.performTest): "When CARDNAME is put into your hand from
# your graveyard, you gain 2 life". It names no TriggerZones$, so it is active
# in the hand the card went to (TriggerReplacementBase.java:61-65).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
queue targets 2
castspell human 1
resolvestack
